# Copy to `.env.web.local` at the repository root with `pnpm reset-env`, fill
# it in there, and `pnpm dev` copies it to `apps/web/.env.local` before Vite
# starts. Both copies are gitignored: never commit real values.
#
# **The web app reads no environment variables today**, so this file is empty
# of keys on purpose. It exists so the plumbing is already in place the first
# time one is needed, rather than being invented in a hurry then.
#
# Two things to know before adding one:
#
# 1. **Only a `VITE_`-prefixed key reaches the browser.** Vite refuses to
#    expose anything else, which is the right default: everything in this file
#    ends up in the bundle, readable by anybody who opens the network tab.
#    Nothing secret can live here. Secrets belong in `.env.server.local`,
#    which the server reads and never sends out.
#
# 2. **The API base URL is not configurable and must not become one.** One
#    Fastify process serves both `/api` and the built app from a single origin,
#    which is why there is no CORS configuration either. See
#    `docs/architecture.md`.
